{{!--
    A settlement map's bar (board L3), under the world bar: the way back to its pin on the Surface
    map, and the settlement, what it is and the map it is made from. Its view is the canvas's own
    controls' (zoom, and the town view); the framings come back in Export (Ken, 2026-11-24). Context:
    mapBar (LocalController.barContext). Its button is the Local studio's (data-action="local").
--}}
<div class="fwmb-settlement-bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="{{mapBar.name}}">
    <button type="button" class="fwmb-btn fwmb-settlement-back" data-action="local" data-local="backToPin"{{#if mapBar.pinGone}} disabled{{/if}}><span class="fwmb-icon fwmb-icon--location-city" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{mapBar.back}}</button>
    <span class="fwmb-settlement-what"><b>{{mapBar.name}}</b>{{#if mapBar.what}} · {{mapBar.what}}{{/if}} · {{mapBar.from}}</span>
</div>
